<p dir="ltr"><strong>Step 3: Remove the old files</strong><br>
Tap <code dir="ltr">index.html</code> in the repo, then the <strong>â‹¯</strong> menu at the top right â†’ <strong>Delete file</strong> â†’ <strong>Commit changes</strong>. Do the same for <code dir="ltr">app.js</code>.</p>
