<p dir="ltr">You only edit the name here, so nothing needs to be selected or pasted. If the name box wonâ€™t let you type, switch Chrome to Desktop site while youâ€™re in GitHub, then switch it back.</p>
<p dir="ltr">When youâ€™re finished, your repo should list <code dir="ltr">index.html</code>, <code dir="ltr">app.js</code>, <code dir="ltr">airtasker.css</code> and <code dir="ltr">styles.css</code>, with no <code dir="ltr">.txt</code> files left. Wait a minute or two, then hard-refresh the site.</p>
